{"id": "97110122", "name": "סכום n האיברים הראשונים – סדרה חשבונית או הנדסית", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>נתונה סדרה [[if test=\"{{CT:5}}\"]]חשבונית[[/if]][[if test=\"{{CT:6}}\"]]הנדסית[[/if]] שארבעת איבריה הראשונים הם</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:0}},\\ {{CT:1}},\\ {{CT:2}},\\ {{CT:3}},\\ \\ldots \\]</p><p>חשבו את סכום <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:4}}\\)</span> האיברים הראשונים שלה.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(S_{ {{CT:4}} }=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p style=\"font-size:0.92em;margin:8px 0 0\">אפשר להזין ביטוי חשבוני, למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">3*(2^10-1)</code>.</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> [[if test=\"{{CT:5}}\"]]בסדרה חשבונית <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(S_n=\\frac{n\\left(2a_1+(n-1)d\\right)}{2}\\)</span>.[[/if]][[if test=\"{{CT:6}}\"]]בסדרה הנדסית <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(S_n=a_1\\cdot\\frac{q^n-1}{q-1}\\)</span> (כאשר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(q\\ne 1\\)</span>).[[/if]]</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — הנתונים</b><br>[[if test=\"{{CT:5}}\"]]האיבר הראשון <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a_1={{CT:7}}\\)</span>, ההפרש בין איברים עוקבים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(d={{CT:8}}\\)</span>, ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(n={{CT:4}}\\)</span>.[[/if]][[if test=\"{{CT:6}}\"]]האיבר הראשון <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a_1={{CT:9}}\\)</span>, המנה בין איברים עוקבים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(q={{CT:10}}\\)</span>, ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(n={{CT:4}}\\)</span>.[[/if]]</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — הצבה בנוסחה</b><br>[[if test=\"{{CT:5}}\"]]<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ S_{ {{CT:4}} }=\\frac{ {{CT:4}}\\left(2\\cdot\\left({{CT:7}}\\right)+{{CT:11}}\\cdot\\left({{CT:8}}\\right)\\right)}{2}={{CT:12}} \\]</p>[[/if]][[if test=\"{{CT:6}}\"]]<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ S_{ {{CT:4}} }={{CT:9}}\\cdot\\frac{\\left({{CT:10}}\\right)^{ {{CT:4}} }-1}{ {{CT:13}} }={{CT:12}} \\]</p>[[/if]]</div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "sn", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "tn", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">זה האיבר ה-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:4}}\\)</span>, ולא